- Introducing unnecessary large 3D assets.
- Adding huge external dependencies.
- Rebuilding the level architecture.
- Adding visual effects that make combat unreadable.
- Creating chapter identity solely by changing the background color.

The world must remain performant on the project's supported hardware.

